Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.39,0:00:05.05,Main,Hori,0,0,0,,Well, it's official.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.74,0:00:07.14,Main,Hori,0,0,0,,Fall is here.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.23,0:00:10.68,Main,Hori,0,0,0,,Right?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.24,0:00:13.79,Main,Hori,0,0,0,,Right?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.56,0:00:16.89,Main,Hori,0,0,0,,Right?!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.99,0:00:18.83,Main,Sengoku,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.17,0:00:20.24,Main,Miyamura,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.24,0:00:23.12,Main,Sengoku,0,0,0,,Just when we've overcome the pool crisis...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.12,0:00:25.88,Main,Sengoku,0,0,0,,We now face a new challenge, Miyamura-kun.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.88,0:00:28.10,Main,Miyamura,0,0,0,,We do, President.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.10,0:00:30.00,Main,Ishikawa,0,0,0,,{\i1}It's like they're holding a wake.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.70,0:00:33.26,Main,Iura,0,0,0,,I'm here at last!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.58,0:00:37.54,Main,Iura,0,0,0,,And I've brought the team \Nassignments for sports day!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.29,0:00:39.26,Main,Iura,0,0,0,,Wait, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.26,0:00:43.27,Main,_Sign,0,0,0,,{\fnComic Sans MS\shad0\bord0\fs14\frz327.2\pos(173.091,105.819)\c&H505047&\b1}Ba-dump Ba-dump
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.26,0:00:43.27,Main,_Sign,0,0,0,,{\fnComic Sans MS\shad0\bord0\fs14\frz327.2\c&H505047&\b1\pos(256,92.001)}Ba-dump
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.13,0:00:41.91,Main,Iura,0,0,0,,This {\i1}is{\i0} where I turn 'em in, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.91,0:00:43.27,Main,Sakura,0,0,0,,Yes...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.77,0:00:47.83,Main,Sengoku,0,0,0,,As each class brings in their forms,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.83,0:00:50.62,Main,Sengoku,0,0,0,,I feel sports day creeping closer and closer.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.62,0:00:54.15,Main,Hori,0,0,0,,That's not just a feeling. \NIt really is getting closer.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.15,0:00:56.28,Main,_Sign,0,0,0,,{\fnArial\an4\1a&HFF&\bord1\shad0\3c&H2B3435&\b1\clip(0.727,2.182,157.091,360)\move(140.909,210,11.454,210)}AAAAAAAAAAGH
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.28,0:00:59.20,Main,_Sign,0,0,0,,{\fnArial\1a&HFF&\bord1\shad0\3c&H2B3435&\b1\an8)}AAAAAAAAAAGH
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.16,0:01:02.40,Main,Sengoku,0,0,0,,A rain dance!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.70,0:01:04.04,Main,Miyamura,0,0,0,,Rain dance! Rain dance!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.44,0:01:06.54,Main - Top,_Both,0,0,0,,Rain dance! Rain dance!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.54,0:01:09.29,Main,Female Student A,0,0,0,,Excuse me! Here are our team assignments...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.54,0:01:11.96,Main - Top,_Both,0,0,0,,Rain dance! Rain dance!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.64,0:01:10.72,Main,Female Student A,0,0,0,,What's going on?!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.51,0:02:48.02,Main,_Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(1270,940)\fnArial\an8\b1\bord0\fs16\shad1\pos(518.545,111.091)\c&H8BF6CB&\3c&H514946&\4c&H33533F&}Cooking Class
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.84,0:02:48.02,Main,Hori,0,0,0,,Does each class decide team \Nassignments by drawing lots?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.02,0:02:52.50,Main,_Sign,0,0,0,,{\fnTimes New Roman\fad(1,1130)\fs16\shad0\bord0\b1\c&HDDDEE0&\move(193.778,181,413.334,181)}East\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h{\c&H313433&}West
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.02,0:02:52.50,Main,_Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(1,1130)\fnArial\fs14\shad0\bord0\move(153.777,311.111,373.777,311.111)}Boys & Girls\N\N\N\N\N(Half)
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.02,0:02:52.50,Main,_Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(1,1130)\fnArial\fs14\shad0\bord0\c&H313433&\move(236.444,311.111,456,311.111)}Boys & Girls\N\N\N\N\N(Half)
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.02,0:02:55.02,Main,_Sign,0,0,0,,{\fnArial\fs14\shad0\bord0\an8\c&H423E6C&\b1\move(-55.424,55.455,285.818,55.455)}Katagiri High Sports Day Teams Splitting
Dialogue: 1,0:02:48.60,0:02:51.73,Main,Sengoku,0,0,0,,To keep the number of boys and \Ngirls balanced on each team,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.83,0:02:55.02,Main,_Sign,0,0,0,,{\fnTimes New Roman\fs16\shad0\bord0\b1\c&HDDDEE0&\move(-68.286,180.66,136,180.667)}East\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h{\c&H313433&}West
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.83,0:02:55.02,Main,_Sign,0,0,0,,{\fnArial\fs14\shad0\bord0\c&H313433&\move(-27.727,310.727,176.727,310.727)}Boys & Girls\N\N\N\N\N(Half)
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.83,0:02:55.02,Main,_Sign,0,0,0,,{\fnArial\fs14\shad0\bord0\move(-109.777,310.727,94.545,310.727)}Boys & Girls\N\N\N\N\N(Half)
Dialogue: 1,0:02:51.73,0:02:55.02,Main,Sengoku,0,0,0,,each class first divides into boys \Nand girls, then assigns teams.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.02,0:02:58.65,Main,Sengoku,0,0,0,,I expect most of them only draw \Nfor which team they'll be on.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.65,0:03:03.05,Main,Ishikawa,0,0,0,,It must feel pretty weird to be \Ngoing up against your own classmates.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.05,0:03:06.54,Main,Miyamura,0,0,0,,Yeah, I'm glad we're on \Nthe same team, Ishikawa-kun.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.95,0:03:08.92,Main,Ishikawa,0,0,0,,By the way, what team are you on, Sengoku?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.49,0:03:10.41,Main,Sengoku,0,0,0,,East.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.41,0:03:14.67,Main,_Sign,0,0,0,,{\fnArial\b1\shad0\bord3\3c&H5B41BF&\frz9.753\move(140.363,46.001,279.272,81.637,820,1490)}West
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.80,0:03:13.04,Main,Sengoku,0,0,0,,Why are you cheering?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.04,0:03:14.67,Main,Sengoku,0,0,0,,Don't act so relieved!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.08,0:03:16.17,Main,Hori,0,0,0,,Sengoku.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.96,0:03:18.53,Main,Hori,0,0,0,,I'm counting on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.53,0:03:19.84,Main,Sengoku,0,0,0,,{\i1}Seriously?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.46,0:03:21.67,Main,Sengoku,0,0,0,,Wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.67,0:03:24.80,Main,Sengoku,0,0,0,,So you and Miyamura-kun split up?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.11,0:03:27.50,Main,Hori,0,0,0,,We did {\i1}not{\i0} split up. I oughta deck you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.50,0:03:29.31,Main,Sengoku,0,0,0,,I meant for sports day.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.77,0:03:32.65,Main,Hori,0,0,0,,I'm not going to lose to Toru and Miyamura.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.65,0:03:34.50,Main,Sengoku,0,0,0,,Okay. Good luck to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.50,0:03:36.26,Main,Hori,0,0,0,,Good luck to {\i1}us{\i0}.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.69,0:03:39.29,Main,Hori,0,0,0,,Yuki and Iura are on our team, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.69,0:03:41.95,Main,_Sign,0,0,0,,{\fnArial\b1\shad0\c&H2A2A2F&\3c&HE9F0EE&\move(328,297.696,307.636,119.514,2520,3444)\t(2520,3440,\fs16)}Way too excited for sports day
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.61,0:03:41.95,Main,Sengoku,0,0,0,,{\i1}Seriously?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.38,0:03:47.11,Main,Sengoku,0,0,0,,That means I won't be able to \Nstay out of sight and do nothing...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.11,0:03:50.45,Main,Ishikawa,0,0,0,,You just casually made a pretty \Nloaded confession, President.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.86,0:03:53.86,Main,Sakura,0,0,0,,{\i1}I thought he was absent, \Nbut he was staying out of sight?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.31,0:03:57.96,Main,Ishikawa,0,0,0,,Say, the girls are gonna do\Na cheer routine this year, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.65,0:04:00.97,Main,Sengoku,0,0,0,,Will you be participating, Sakura?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.81,0:04:02.87,Main,Sakura,0,0,0,,I will.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.80,0:04:05.72,Main,Sakura,0,0,0,,It's mandatory.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.04,0:04:09.77,Main,Sakura,0,0,0,,For everyone. Even if they\Nhave no sense of rhythm.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.72,0:04:13.48,Main,Sengoku,0,0,0,,Your voice sounds awfully low today...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.48,0:04:15.89,Main,Hori,0,0,0,,We'll need to make pom-poms.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.89,0:04:17.04,Main,Sakura,0,0,0,,Indeed.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.04,0:04:19.84,Main,Hori,0,0,0,,I hope the steps aren't too difficult.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.84,0:04:21.95,Main,Hori,0,0,0,,Are you east or west, Kono-san?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.95,0:04:23.53,Main,Sakura,0,0,0,,I'm on the west team.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.53,0:04:24.93,Main,Sakura,0,0,0,,So is Remi.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.93,0:04:26.41,Main,Hori,0,0,0,,I guess that makes us rivals.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.41,0:04:28.89,Main,Hori,0,0,0,,Toru and Miyamura are west, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.17,0:04:32.62,Main,Sakura,0,0,0,,{\i1}I'm on the same team as Ishikawa-kun...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.12,0:04:35.96,Main,_Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(610,60)\fnArial\b1\fs20\shad0\c&H2A2A2F&\3c&HE9F0EE&\pos(322.182,269.332)}Last year's nightmare
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.21,0:04:40.24,Main,Sakura,0,0,0,,{\i1}And he's going to see me out \Nthere flailing like an idiot!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.88,0:04:43.02,Main,Sakura,0,0,0,,Rain dance! Do a rain dance!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.02,0:04:45.13,Main,Sengoku,0,0,0,,Okay, Sakura, we'll do one together!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.12,0:04:48.03,Main - Top,_Both,0,0,0,,Rain! Rain!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.03,0:04:50.14,Main,Ishikawa,0,0,0,,{\i1}Is the student council okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.03,0:04:50.76,Main - Top,_Both,0,0,0,,Rain! Rain!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.77,0:04:57.99,Main,Hori,0,0,0,,Honestly, Sengoku's always been clumsy...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.69,0:05:01.78,Main,Hori,0,0,0,,but as the council president, \Nhe needs to get it together.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.78,0:05:05.64,Main,Miyamura,0,0,0,,I guess he's never been much of an athlete.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.64,0:05:08.41,Main,Hori,0,0,0,,Pretty much. I remember him \Ntripping and crying a lot.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.45,0:05:12.91,Main,_Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(980,1)\fnArial\b1\fs16\shad0\c&H2A2A2F&\3c&HE9F0EE&\pos(293.819,54.786)}Came home covered in dirt\Nafter running amok at sports day
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.51,0:05:12.24,Main,Hori,0,0,0,,He could learn a thing or two from Sota.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.91,0:05:14.71,Main,Miyamura,0,0,0,,Huh? Oh...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.11,0:05:16.52,Main,Miyamura,0,0,0,,Y'know...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.05,0:05:21.78,Main,Miyamura,0,0,0,,I don't have any fond memories \Nof sports days either.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.50,0:05:29.20,Main,Hori,0,0,0,,You're a good runner, \Nso enter the 100-meter dash.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.20,0:05:30.14,Main,Miyamura,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.14,0:05:31.56,Main,Hori,0,0,0,,No buts!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.13,0:05:34.06,Main,Hori,0,0,0,,Give us everything you've got!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.75,0:05:37.93,Main,Hori,0,0,0,,I'll be doing the same.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.93,0:05:40.44,Main,Hori,0,0,0,,Absolutely no slacking. Or else!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.53,0:05:47.70,Main,Hori,0,0,0,,I'm not really an athlete myself, \Nbut I think it'll be more fun than last year.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.32,0:05:49.35,Main,Hori,0,0,0,,Call it a hunch.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.93,0:05:53.68,Main,Miyamura,0,0,0,,So I should do my best \Nin the 100-meter dash?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.68,0:05:54.97,Main,Hori,0,0,0,,Your absolute best.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.97,0:05:57.50,Main,Miyamura,0,0,0,,And I should cheer a lot?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.50,0:05:59.16,Main,Hori,0,0,0,,As much as you can.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.16,0:06:01.71,Main,Miyamura,0,0,0,,Will you cheer for me?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.71,0:06:03.92,Main,Hori,0,0,0,,Of course I will!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.92,0:06:06.02,Main,Miyamura,0,0,0,,We're on different teams, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.46,0:06:07.23,Main,Hori,0,0,0,,I...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.23,0:06:09.23,Main,Hori,0,0,0,,I know that.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.55,0:06:12.35,Main,Hori,0,0,0,,But I'll still be watching.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.30,0:06:15.30,Main,Miyamura,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.72,0:06:17.55,Main,Miyamura,0,0,0,,{\i1}How strange.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.55,0:06:20.73,Main,Miyamura,0,0,0,,{\i1}I used to wish it would\Nbe over as soon as possible,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.53,0:06:24.06,Main,Miyamura,0,0,0,,{\i1}but now I'm actually looking forward to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.20,0:06:28.48,Main,Shindo,0,0,0,,{\i1}Yo, Miyamura! Can I swing by \Ntomorrow evening?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.48,0:06:31.67,Main,Miyamura,0,0,0,,No, I'm getting ready for sports day.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.18,0:06:36.26,Main,Shindo,0,0,0,,{\i1}We did ours in June.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.26,0:06:38.75,Main,Shindo,0,0,0,,{\i1}What are you entering? Or are you skipping?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.27,0:06:43.18,Main,Miyamura,0,0,0,,{\i1}I haven't decided, \Nbut I might do the 100-meter dash.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.23,0:06:45.50,Main,Shindo,0,0,0,,Whoa.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.95,0:06:47.51,Main,Shindo,0,0,0,,{\i1}You sound surprisingly motivated.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.53,0:06:51.60,Main,Miyamura,0,0,0,,Yeah. I surprisingly am.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.08,0:06:54.26,Main,Shindo,0,0,0,,Nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.90,0:06:57.23,Main,Shindo,0,0,0,,{\i1}I might just come watch!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.23,0:06:58.67,Main,Miyamura,0,0,0,,Don't, jerk.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.72,0:07:02.52,Main,Miyamura,0,0,0,,{\i1}I think the days ahead
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.96,0:07:06.37,Main,Miyamura,0,0,0,,{\i1}will be a little more lively than usual.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.14,0:07:11.16,Main,Female Student Voice,0,0,0,,That's enough for today. Good work!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.82,0:07:15.39,Main,Sakura,0,0,0,,This is hard.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.66,0:07:19.20,Main,Sakura,0,0,0,,{\i1}I'm the only one having \Ntrouble with the moves.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.60,0:07:22.24,Main,Sakura,0,0,0,,{\i1}At this rate, I'll make \Na fool of myself this year, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.96,0:07:24.29,Main,Sakura,0,0,0,,{\i1}And this year...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.94,0:07:28.30,Main,Sakura,0,0,0,,{\i1}And this year, Ishikawa-kun \Nmight be watching.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.14,0:07:31.46,Main,Yuki,0,0,0,,Kono-san?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.51,0:07:34.19,Main,Sakura,0,0,0,,Yoshikawa-san?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.19,0:07:35.55,Main,Yuki,0,0,0,,What's the matter?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.88,0:07:37.59,Main,Yuki,0,0,0,,A-Are you not feeling well?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.59,0:07:39.60,Main,Sakura,0,0,0,,No, that's not it!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.60,0:07:41.83,Main,Yuki,0,0,0,,So it's something else? Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.22,0:07:44.84,Main,Sakura,0,0,0,,We were just practicing our cheer routine.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.84,0:07:47.14,Main,Yuki,0,0,0,,Wait, was there cheer practice today?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.14,0:07:50.06,Main,Sakura,0,0,0,,Oh, I'm on the west team.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.06,0:07:52.45,Main,Yuki,0,0,0,,Gotcha. I'm east.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.85,0:07:57.13,Main,Sakura,0,0,0,,I'm not athletic,\Nand I have no sense of rhythm...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.13,0:07:59.33,Main,Sakura,0,0,0,,so it's really getting the better of me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.70,0:08:03.84,Main,Sakura,0,0,0,,I'm sorry! It's nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.84,0:08:06.71,Main,Sakura,0,0,0,,I'll practice a little more.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.22,0:08:09.09,Main,Sakura,0,0,0,,Right. Left.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.09,0:08:10.97,Main,Sakura,0,0,0,,Left. Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.97,0:08:13.47,Main,Sakura,0,0,0,,W-Wait, was it left? Um...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.57,0:08:16.77,Main,Yuki,0,0,0,,Is that the part both teams do?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.77,0:08:17.47,Main,Sakura,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.47,0:08:18.56,Main,Yuki,0,0,0,,Right!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.97,0:08:23.87,Main,Yuki,0,0,0,,When your right hand goes up,\Nput your left to your chest.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.87,0:08:25.03,Main,Yuki,0,0,0,,Do it with me now.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.03,0:08:26.51,Main,Sakura,0,0,0,,O-Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.20,0:08:29.21,Main,Yuki,0,0,0,,Hit the other side twice.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.66,0:08:32.23,Main,Yuki,0,0,0,,Then turn a little and throw a punch!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.23,0:08:34.24,Main,Sakura,0,0,0,,Th-Throw a punch.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.59,0:08:37.24,Main,Yuki,0,0,0,,Then put your hands up\N and shake, shake, shake.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.24,0:08:39.95,Main,Yuki,0,0,0,,{bg}One, two, three, four!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.95,0:08:42.50,Main,Sakura,0,0,0,,{bg}One, two, three, four...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.88,0:08:45.25,Main,Yuki,0,0,0,,{bg}One, two, three, four!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.25,0:08:49.75,Main,_Both,0,0,0,,Right, left... Shake, shake, shake!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.75,0:08:52.26,Main - Italics,Sengoku,0,0,0,,Why are they practicing when \Nthey're on different teams?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.57,0:08:55.25,Flashback - Italics,Sakura,0,0,0,,I'd rather not do the cheer.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.99,0:08:59.18,Main,Yuki,0,0,0,,You've got this, Kono-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.18,0:09:00.62,Main,Sakura,0,0,0,,D-Do I?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.26,0:09:06.20,Main,Sengoku,0,0,0,,Well, as long as they're having fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.15,0:09:13.15,Main - Italics,Sakura,0,0,0,,I like Sengoku-kun and Remi.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.87,0:09:15.14,Main - Italics,Sakura,0,0,0,,I really do.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.29,0:09:18.03,Flashback,Sakura,0,0,0,,All you had to do was mix.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.54,0:09:20.40,Flashback,Sengoku,0,0,0,,You're angry.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.99,0:09:24.91,Flashback,Sakura,0,0,0,,Whether I'm angry or not \Nisn't the point right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.91,0:09:26.66,Flashback,Remi,0,0,0,,Should I add this?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.91,0:09:31.16,Main,_Sign,0,0,0,,{\fnArial\fs10\b1\c&H374D50&\3c&HF1F4F3&\bord1\shad1\4c&HB2AA7D&\pos(328.666,242)}Potato Starch
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.66,0:09:28.85,Flashback,Sakura,0,0,0,,Hold it, Remi! That's not right!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.85,0:09:30.41,Flashback,Sakura,0,0,0,,Read the label!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.16,0:09:33.42,Flashback,Sengoku,0,0,0,,That's the wrong thing. You need this, Remi.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.16,0:09:38.05,Main,_Sign,0,0,0,,{\fnArial\fs10\b1\c&H2E3DD1&\3c&HA6E3F4&\bord1\shad0\4c&HB2AA7D&\pos(281.333,171.333)}Worcestershire
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.42,0:09:35.64,Flashback,Sakura,0,0,0,,No! Sengoku-kun, stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.64,0:09:38.05,Flashback,Sakura,0,0,0,,You don't add that now! \NDid you read the recipe?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.61,0:09:42.30,Flashback,Sakura,0,0,0,,Watch what you're doing!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.93,0:09:46.76,Flashback,Sengoku,0,0,0,,Sakura, this says "salt." Is it salt?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.93,0:09:49.43,Main,_Sign,0,0,0,,{\fnArial\fs10\b1\shad1\c&HD3BA4B&\3c&H9A5F36&\bord1\4c&H9A5F36&\frz6.515\pos(156,227.333)}Cooking Salt
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.18,0:09:49.43,Main,_Sign,0,0,0,,{\fnArial\fs16\b1\c&H812C19&\3c&HF1F4F3&\bord2\shad0\4c&HB2AA7D&\pos(312.666,112)\frz3.814}Salt
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.76,0:09:49.43,Flashback,Sakura,0,0,0,,If it says salt, then it usually is!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.94,0:09:53.56,Flashback,Sakura,0,0,0,,You're making too big a mess \Nwhen you mix things!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.17,0:09:56.97,Flashback,Male Student A,0,0,0,,Sengoku-kun's group is \Nstill mixing ingredients.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.97,0:09:58.94,Flashback,Female Student B,0,0,0,,Class is nearly over.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.45,0:10:02.07,Flashback,Sakura,0,0,0,,Never mind. Sengoku-kun, chop the vegetables.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.07,0:10:03.57,Flashback,Sakura,0,0,0,,You can handle that, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.98,0:10:06.70,Flashback,Sengoku,0,0,0,,Huh? Chop? {\i1}Me{\i0}?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.61,0:10:09.79,Flashback,Sakura,0,0,0,,Peel it first!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.79,0:10:11.67,Flashback,Sengoku,0,0,0,,Oops, I forgot.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.67,0:10:14.44,Flashback,Sakura,0,0,0,,How can you not see the skin is still on?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.01,0:10:16.21,Flashback,Sakura,0,0,0,,What about Remi?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.11,0:10:18.46,Flashback,Sakura,0,0,0,,That's not how you hold it!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.01,0:10:21.25,Flashback,Sakura,0,0,0,,No more knives for you!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.25,0:10:23.74,Flashback,Remi,0,0,0,,But I want to chop vegetables.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.74,0:10:25.75,Flashback,Sakura,0,0,0,,Not right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.75,0:10:28.47,Flashback,Sakura,0,0,0,,That's already going to give me nightmares.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.08,0:10:32.72,Flashback,Sakura,0,0,0,,Just stir this slowly and carefully.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.72,0:10:34.82,Flashback,Sakura,0,0,0,,And don't do anything else.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.82,0:10:37.02,Flashback,Remi,0,0,0,,Just stir it? Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.02,0:10:37.48,Main,_Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,1)\fnArial\b1\shad0\c&H454043&\3c&HE4E4E4&\i1\pos(543.333,244.667)}Ow
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.02,0:10:37.89,Flashback,Sengoku,0,0,0,,Ow.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.36,0:10:40.16,Flashback,Sengoku,0,0,0,,I cut myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.55,0:10:42.86,Flashback,Sengoku,0,0,0,,I need a bandage...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.61,0:10:46.06,Flashback,Sakura,0,0,0,,Wait. You need to wash it first, Sengoku-kun.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.06,0:10:47.50,Flashback,Sengoku,0,0,0,,Oh, right.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.12,0:10:51.24,Flashback,Sakura,0,0,0,,Now let's go get you a bandage.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.02,0:10:55.18,Flashback,Remi,0,0,0,,Sakura, is this stirred enough?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.18,0:10:56.88,Flashback,Remi,0,0,0,,Hey, Sakura?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.25,0:10:59.09,Flashback,Remi,0,0,0,,I'll put some of that stuff in.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.09,0:11:00.16,Flashback,Remi,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.16,0:11:02.88,Flashback,Remi,0,0,0,,Hey, it's getting all wibbly.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.43,0:11:05.13,Flashback,Sakura,0,0,0,,Are you done yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.13,0:11:07.56,Flashback,Remi,0,0,0,,Sakura, does this look right?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.56,0:11:09.36,Flashback,Sakura,0,0,0,,Why is it smoking?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.04,0:11:11.85,Flashback,Female Student C,0,0,0,,W-We need ventilation!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.85,0:11:14.08,Flashback,Male Student B,0,0,0,,What is this? It's getting in my eyes!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.47,0:11:16.51,Flashback,Male Student C,0,0,0,,Open the windows!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.02,0:11:24.35,Main - Italics,Sakura,0,0,0,,That's... how our last cooking class went.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.38,0:11:29.18,Main,Sakura,0,0,0,,Look at me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.18,0:11:31.05,Main,_Both,0,0,0,,You're angry.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.05,0:11:33.13,Main,Sakura,0,0,0,,Look at me so you understand!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.13,0:11:35.03,Main,Sakura,0,0,0,,What are we making today?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.43,0:11:36.54,Main,_Both,0,0,0,,Curry.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.54,0:11:37.72,Main,Sakura,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.18,0:11:40.05,Main,Sakura,0,0,0,,What ingredients did you bring?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.05,0:11:41.07,Main,Sengoku,0,0,0,,A daikon.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.05,0:11:42.05,Main,_Sign,0,0,0,,{\an8\fnTimes New Roman\b1\shad0\bord3\3c&H72EAA8&\c&H191E1C&\pos(242.182,221.273)}Daikon Radish
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.07,0:11:42.05,Main,Sakura,0,0,0,,Why?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.05,0:11:43.06,Main,Remi,0,0,0,,Tofu.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.05,0:11:44.05,Main,_Sign,0,0,0,,{\an8\fnTimes New Roman\b1\shad0\bord3\3c&HE3CD90&\c&H191E1C&\pos(360,233.637)}Tofu
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.06,0:11:44.05,Main,Sakura,0,0,0,,Why?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.57,0:11:47.91,Main,Sakura,0,0,0,,Sengoku-kun, when you have curry at \Nhome, is there daikon in it?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.91,0:11:50.81,Main,Sengoku,0,0,0,,No, I don't think so.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.14,0:11:52.66,Main,Sakura,0,0,0,,Then why did you bring one?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.66,0:11:56.71,Main,Sengoku,0,0,0,,I've only seen curry once \Nit's already in a pot.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.71,0:11:59.94,Main,Sengoku,0,0,0,,I wasn't sure what to start with.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.94,0:12:03.15,Main,Sakura,0,0,0,,With the vegetables you usually see in curry.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.15,0:12:03.95,Main,Sengoku,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.95,0:12:07.93,Main,Sengoku,0,0,0,,Does placing vegetables around \Nthe pot bring forth the curry?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.93,0:12:09.33,Main,Sakura,0,0,0,,You {\i1}cook{\i0} them!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.85,0:12:14.30,Main,Sakura,0,0,0,,The class picked curry so that \Nyou two would be able to do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.30,0:12:16.71,Main,Sakura,0,0,0,,Okay, tell me what you {\i1}can{\i0} make.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.71,0:12:18.15,Main,Sengoku,0,0,0,,Pasta.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.15,0:12:19.21,Main,Remi,0,0,0,,Croquettes.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.21,0:12:24.28,Main,Sakura,0,0,0,,Warming up prepackaged food\Ndoes not count as "making" it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.28,0:12:26.22,Main,Remi,0,0,0,,I-I know!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.63,0:12:30.10,Main,Sakura,0,0,0,,Let's start by chipping \Nthe vegetables I brought—
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.10,0:12:32.63,Main,Sakura,0,0,0,,Ah! No knives for you, Remi!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.35,0:12:37.46,Main,Sakura,0,0,0,,And you be careful, Sengoku-kun.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.98,0:12:42.61,Main,Sakura,0,0,0,,{\i1}H-He's gotten better!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.96,0:12:46.04,Main,Sakura,0,0,0,,Wow, Sengoku-kun, you're doing great!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.04,0:12:48.70,Main,Sakura,0,0,0,,That's it. Just peel off the skin—
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.12,0:12:53.50,Main,_Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(770,1)\pos(196.364,91.818)\fnArial\fs16\b1\c&H4B4E5B&\3c&HE7EAED&\4c&H261F2E&}The missing potato...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.93,0:12:51.77,Main,Sengoku,0,0,0,,The potato disappeared!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.77,0:12:53.50,Main,Sakura,0,0,0,,Why did you pare away the whole thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.50,0:12:58.25,Main,_Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(730,1)\fnArial\fs16\b1\c&H30323F&\3c&HE7EAED&\4c&H261F2E&\pos(456,44.545)}The missing onion...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.42,0:12:56.15,Main,Remi,0,0,0,,The onion disappeared, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.15,0:12:58.25,Main,Sakura,0,0,0,,You're not supposed to peel it to nothing!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.25,0:13:02.01,Main,Sakura,0,0,0,,Well, the class thought this might happen
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.01,0:13:05.41,Main,Sakura,0,0,0,,and each group shared some of their \Ncurry with us. Isn't that great?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.41,0:13:07.00,Main - Italics,_Both,0,0,0,,They know us too well.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.00,0:13:09.10,Main,Sakura,0,0,0,,Sengoku-kun, warm up the curry.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.10,0:13:11.02,Main,Sakura,0,0,0,,Remi, plate the rice.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.86,0:13:15.02,Main,Remi,0,0,0,,Will I never be able to cook?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.54,0:13:18.52,Main,Sengoku,0,0,0,,If you work hard, \NI'm sure you will someday.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.52,0:13:20.93,Main,Sakura,0,0,0,,The stove! Why are the flames so high?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.97,0:13:23.20,Main,Sengoku,0,0,0,,It was on high heat?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.20,0:13:25.31,Main,Sakura,0,0,0,,High heat? {\i1}That{\i0} was high heat?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.72,0:13:27.76,Main,Sakura,0,0,0,,What did you do?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.76,0:13:29.65,Main,Remi,0,0,0,,Sakura...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.83,0:13:34.79,Main,Remi,0,0,0,,I'm... I'm s... I'm s-s-sorry...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.24,0:13:38.46,Main,Remi,0,0,0,,The rice I made turned into gruel...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.46,0:13:40.02,Main,Sakura,0,0,0,,Don't cry.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.02,0:13:41.46,Main,Sakura,0,0,0,,Let it go.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.00,0:13:44.45,Main,Remi,0,0,0,,Rice gruel will work fine, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.45,0:13:46.09,Main,Sengoku,0,0,0,,Y-Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.09,0:13:50.10,Main,Remi,0,0,0,,Soupy rice gruel and gooey curry...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.10,0:13:51.69,Main,Sakura,0,0,0,,L-Let's eat.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.05,0:13:54.72,Main,Sakura,0,0,0,,Hey, it's pretty good.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.72,0:13:56.36,Main,Sakura,0,0,0,,It's good, Remi.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.36,0:13:59.73,Main,Remi,0,0,0,,Yeah, but the rice isn't cooked all the way...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.09,0:14:01.64,Main,Sengoku,0,0,0,,Thank you guys, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.64,0:14:03.48,Main,Male Student D,0,0,0,,Nah, don't worry about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.48,0:14:05.95,Main,Male Student E,0,0,0,,I hope things turn out better next time.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.44,0:14:08.49,Main,Remi,0,0,0,,Sakura, I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.49,0:14:10.55,Main,Remi,0,0,0,,I mess everything up.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.55,0:14:14.24,Main,Sakura,0,0,0,,It's okay. Everyone has things \Nthey're not good at.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.87,0:14:17.50,Main,Remi,0,0,0,,You'll make a great wife, Sakura.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.50,0:14:21.38,Main,Sakura,0,0,0,,Huh? That takes much more than just cooking.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.38,0:14:24.22,Main,Remi,0,0,0,,But it's still better if you can cook.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.63,0:14:26.31,Main,Remi,0,0,0,,What should I do?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.31,0:14:28.55,Main,Remi,0,0,0,,No one will want to marry me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.55,0:14:29.76,Main,Sengoku,0,0,0,,Me either.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.76,0:14:32.26,Main,Sengoku,0,0,0,,No one will want me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.26,0:14:34.94,Main,Sakura,0,0,0,,You'll be fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.94,0:14:39.34,Main,Sakura,0,0,0,,If no one wants you, I'll marry you both.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.91,0:14:46.36,Main,Remi,0,0,0,,Thank you, Sakura! You're so cool!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.36,0:14:48.64,Main - Italics,_All,0,0,0,,Kono-san is boyfriend material.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.40,0:14:52.28,Main,Yuki,0,0,0,,Ta-da! Sports day T-shirts!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.93,0:14:54.35,Main,Yuki,0,0,0,,The west shirts are over there.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.35,0:14:55.79,Main,Yuki,0,0,0,,This is a medium size.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.18,0:14:57.98,Main,Yuki,0,0,0,,Need a medium, Miyamura?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.98,0:14:59.61,Main,Miyamura,0,0,0,,Huh? A large.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.61,0:15:00.46,Main,Yuki,0,0,0,,Maybe a small?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.46,0:15:02.29,Main,Miyamura,0,0,0,,Those are for girls.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.29,0:15:04.64,Main,Yuki,0,0,0,,No mercy for the west team!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.64,0:15:06.05,Main,Yuki,0,0,0,,Jeez, Miyamura.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.53,0:15:09.80,Main,Yuki,0,0,0,,You're such a pushover.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.80,0:15:12.79,Flashback - Italics,Hori,0,0,0,,Absolutely no slacking. Or else!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.99,0:15:17.73,Main,Miyamura,0,0,0,,Then you're a pushover-over, Yoshikawa-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.73,0:15:19.31,Main,Yuki,0,0,0,,That's too many overs!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.67,0:15:21.10,Main,Ishikawa,0,0,0,,Hey, Yoshikawa.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.10,0:15:22.86,Main,Ishikawa,0,0,0,,Got an extra west shirt in large?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.86,0:15:24.16,Main,Yuki,0,0,0,,Sure do.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.16,0:15:27.41,Main,Yuki,0,0,0,,You're on the committee, Toru,\Nso give me a hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.41,0:15:30.76,Main,Female Student A,0,0,0,,Yoshikawa-san,\Ndo you have a small east shirt?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.76,0:15:33.18,Main,Male Student F,0,0,0,,Yoshikawa, where are the west mediums?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.18,0:15:35.25,Main,Female Student D,0,0,0,,Yuki-chan, do you have a west small?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.85,0:15:37.47,Main,Yuki,0,0,0,,For crying out loud...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.47,0:15:40.08,Main,Yuki,0,0,0,,Just get them yourselves!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.08,0:15:41.85,Main,_All,0,0,0,,Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.51,0:15:45.96,Main,Ishikawa,0,0,0,,By the way, what'd you enter, Miyamura?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.96,0:15:49.21,Main,Miyamura,0,0,0,,Hmm... The 100-meter, I think.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.21,0:15:51.25,Main,Ishikawa,0,0,0,,You should be in the relay.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.99,0:15:53.73,Main,Miyamura,0,0,0,,No, that's too much pressure!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.73,0:15:55.99,Main,Miyamura,0,0,0,,That's just for the track team.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.99,0:15:59.98,Main,Ishikawa,0,0,0,,Not really. Shu did it as a first-year.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.98,0:16:04.48,Main,_Sign,0,0,0,,{\an1\fnArial\b1\shad0\fs20\pos(22.364,53.273)\c&H302C46&\3c&HEDEFEF&}Track Team
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.28,0:16:03.04,Main,Ishikawa,0,0,0,,Though the track team did smoke him.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.04,0:16:04.48,Main,Miyamura,0,0,0,,Uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.48,0:16:07.89,Main,Miyamura,0,0,0,,Well, the other team has the president.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.89,0:16:11.99,Main,Ishikawa,0,0,0,,Yeah, that really improves \Nour chances of winning.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.31,0:16:15.17,Main,Miyamura,0,0,0,,I hope he comes to sports day.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.17,0:16:17.28,Main,Ishikawa,0,0,0,,He should at least come to school.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.28,0:16:18.41,Main,Ishikawa,0,0,0,,This is our last sports day.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.41,0:16:20.25,Main,_Sign,0,0,0,,{\an7\fad(600,1)\fnArial\b1\fs16\shad0\c&H2A2A2F&\3c&HE9F0EE&\pos(428.365,146.422)}The president may\Ncease to exist that day
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.85,0:16:20.25,Flashback,Sengoku,0,0,0,,Rain!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.25,0:16:24.69,Main,Miyamura,0,0,0,,All of the boys have to do the mock \Ncavalry battle and topple-the-pole.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.69,0:16:27.58,Main,Ishikawa,0,0,0,,The other events are coed.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.03,0:16:30.38,Main,Ishikawa,0,0,0,,Cheer practice looks pretty hard.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.38,0:16:33.27,Main,Miyamura,0,0,0,,{\i1}Hori-san will be cheering too, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.27,0:16:34.88,Main,Female Student E,0,0,0,,You look great, Hori-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.88,0:16:36.73,Main,Female Student F,0,0,0,,So cool!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.73,0:16:37.84,Main,Hori,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.84,0:16:39.64,Main,Female Student G,0,0,0,,That decides it!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.05,0:16:41.95,Main,Hori,0,0,0,,How do you think I look, Miyamura?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.95,0:16:43.02,Main,Miyamura,0,0,0,,It's complicated.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.02,0:16:44.02,Main,Hori,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.45,0:16:46.66,Main,Miyamura,0,0,0,,{\i1}It's not what I pictured.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.73,0:16:53.22,Main,Yasuda,0,0,0,,And in this sentence,\Nthis noun gets modified...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.22,0:16:55.38,Main,Yasuda,0,0,0,,so make sure not to get confused.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.62,0:16:57.46,Main,_Sign,0,0,0,,{\fnTimes New Roman\b1\fs18\c&H292B35&\3c&HD4D8DA&\4c&H292B35&\pos(588.667,217.333)}Monstrous\NRage
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.47,0:17:02.90,Main - Italics,Ishikawa,0,0,0,,Wh-What gives, Hori?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.62,0:17:04.13,Main,_Sign,0,0,0,,{\fnTimes New Roman\b1\fs18\c&H292B35&\3c&HD4D8DA&\4c&H292B35&\pos(332.667,51.334)}Deathly Chill
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.50,0:17:09.51,Main,_Sign,0,0,0,,{\fnTimes New Roman\b1\fs18\c&H292B35&\3c&HD4D8DA&\4c&H292B35&\pos(92.666,80.667)}Haunting Aura
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.09,0:17:09.51,Main - Italics,Ishikawa,0,0,0,,Ghostly rapping!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.38,0:17:13.34,Main,Yasuda,0,0,0,,Now read the next sentence, Hori.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.33,0:17:17.27,Main,Hori,0,0,0,,"It's mine."
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.60,0:17:20.35,Main,Yasuda,0,0,0,,You can ease up on the emotion a bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.35,0:17:21.52,Main,Yasuda,0,0,0,,How would you translate that?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.52,0:17:23.84,Main,Hori,0,0,0,,Get away from her, idiot.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.33,0:17:26.24,Main,Yasuda,0,0,0,,Where does it say that?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.29,0:17:32.28,Main,Miyamura,0,0,0,,She just forgot her textbook.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.74,0:17:35.04,Main,Hori,0,0,0,,Yeah? That so?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.43,0:17:36.56,Main,Miyamura,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.56,0:17:38.03,Main,Miyamura,0,0,0,,I was just showing her mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.61,0:17:40.53,Main,Hori,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.07,0:17:44.85,Main,Miyamura,0,0,0,,Oh no!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.85,0:17:46.42,Main,Hori,0,0,0,,"Oh no" what?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.77,0:17:49.28,Main,Miyamura,0,0,0,,You're angry at me, Hori-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.28,0:17:52.40,Main,Hori,0,0,0,,Y-You don't need to be scared. \NI haven't said anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.88,0:17:56.93,Main,Miyamura,0,0,0,,I have nothing to hide. I swear.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.93,0:18:00.89,Main,Hori,0,0,0,,But... I wasn't worried about that!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.89,0:18:01.97,Main,Hori,0,0,0,,I just...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.71,0:18:04.94,Main,Hori,0,0,0,,Never mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.86,0:18:12.45,Main,Yuki,0,0,0,,You're scary when you get jealous, Hori.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.45,0:18:14.23,Main,Hori,0,0,0,,Jealous?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.23,0:18:16.19,Main,Hori,0,0,0,,I wasn't feeling jealous.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.63,0:18:18.18,Main,Hori,0,0,0,,It was more like murderous.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.05,0:18:22.71,Main,Yuki,0,0,0,,Maybe you should stick \Nto jealousy from now on.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.02,0:18:24.27,Main,Yuki,0,0,0,,Was it just you?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.01,0:18:27.78,Main,Yuki,0,0,0,,Were you the only one feeling jealous?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.78,0:18:29.43,Main,Hori,0,0,0,,Oh, well...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.09,0:18:37.85,Main,_Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(1,2320)\fnImpact\shad0\c&H383C56&\3c&HEEF4F1&\pos(321.697,41.788)}Things I can say to reassure her
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.64,0:18:37.85,Main,_Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(430,2320)\fnArial\fs10\shad0\an3\3c&HF3916B&\c&H3D373A&\b1\pos(90.667,138)}Maybe he just \Ndoesn't show it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.14,0:18:37.85,Main,_Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(430,2320)\fnArial\fs10\shad0\an3\3c&HF3916B&\c&H3D373A&\b1\pos(93.334,175.333)}I'm sure he's \Njealous deep down.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.64,0:18:37.85,Main,_Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(430,2320)\fnArial\fs10\shad0\an3\3c&HF3916B&\c&H3D373A&\b1\pos(91.334,213.333)}You're {\i1}too{\i0}\N jealous, Hori!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.14,0:18:35.56,Main,_Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(430,1)\fnArial\fs10\shad0\an3\3c&HF3916B&\c&H3D373A&\b1\pos(93.334,248)}Don't sweat it!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.64,0:18:37.85,Main,_Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(430,2320)\fnArial\fs10\shad0\an3\3c&HF3916B&\c&H3D373A&\b1\pos(94,288)}All guys are\N like that!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.56,0:18:37.85,Main,_Sign,0,0,0,,{\fnArial\fs10\shad0\an3\3c&HF3916B&\c&H3D373A&\b1\t(1,1530,\fs24)\move(93.334,248,397.334,145.333,1,1530)}Don't sweat it!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.21,0:18:39.41,Main,Yuki,0,0,0,,Don't sweat it!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.92,0:18:41.09,Main,Hori,0,0,0,,Thanks...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.59,0:18:45.70,Main,Miyamura,0,0,0,,Hey, it's Hori-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.70,0:18:46.85,Main,Hori,0,0,0,,Miyamura?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.85,0:18:48.32,Main,Hori,0,0,0,,And Toru!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.32,0:18:49.86,Main,Ishikawa,0,0,0,,You've even got Yoshikawa.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.86,0:18:51.47,Main,Ishikawa,0,0,0,,You almost done painting?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.47,0:18:52.86,Main,Yuki,0,0,0,,Just about.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.54,0:18:57.91,Main,Ishikawa,0,0,0,,They called a meeting for the sports day \Ncommittee third-years over the intercom.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.91,0:19:00.36,Main,Ishikawa,0,0,0,,They said to come as soon as you can.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.36,0:19:03.19,Main,Yuki,0,0,0,,What? But I'm not quite finished.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.19,0:19:04.77,Main,Hori,0,0,0,,I can wrap up the painting.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.77,0:19:05.87,Main,Yuki,0,0,0,,Thanks—
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.47,0:19:08.98,Main,Yuki,0,0,0,,Hori, what was your grade in art class?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.98,0:19:10.28,Main,Hori,0,0,0,,Why bring that up?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.28,0:19:12.13,Main,Hori,0,0,0,,Just get going already.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.88,0:19:17.31,Main,Yuki,0,0,0,,Thanks! I'll be back right after the meeting.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.77,0:19:21.94,Main,Hori,0,0,0,,I just need to paint inside the lines, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.94,0:19:23.64,Main,Hori,0,0,0,,Easy enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.14,0:19:26.64,Main,Hori,0,0,0,,Yuki was worried for nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.25,0:19:32.81,Main,Hori,0,0,0,,I wish I had worn my blazer.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.81,0:19:35.77,Main,Mizouchi,0,0,0,,Hori, aren't you cold out here?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.27,0:19:37.78,Main,Hori,0,0,0,,Mizouchi.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.78,0:19:39.36,Main,Hori,0,0,0,,Yeah, I'm cold.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.77,0:19:42.14,Main,Hori,0,0,0,,Girls have to put up with bare legs.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.76,0:19:48.15,Main,Mizouchi,0,0,0,,Keep that over your lap.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.15,0:19:49.41,Main,Mizouchi,0,0,0,,It won't be as bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.18,0:19:51.92,Main,Mizouchi,0,0,0,,You can return it when you're done.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.92,0:19:53.86,Main,Hori,0,0,0,,Wait, Mizouchi!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.99,0:19:57.10,Main,Hori,0,0,0,,I might get paint on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.19,0:20:02.30,Main,Miyamura,0,0,0,,Hori-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.61,0:20:04.61,Main,Miyamura,0,0,0,,You done?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.61,0:20:06.73,Main,Hori,0,0,0,,You startled me.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.73,0:20:08.68,Main,Hori,0,0,0,,I'm not done yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.19,0:20:13.37,Main,Miyamura,0,0,0,,Whose is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.94,0:20:15.36,Main,Hori,0,0,0,,Mizouchi's.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.83,0:20:18.72,Main,Hori,0,0,0,,I said my legs were cold,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.72,0:20:19.94,Main,Hori,0,0,0,,and he let me borrow it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.72,0:20:42.42,Main,Hori,0,0,0,,This is warmer than a blazer.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.25,0:20:46.69,Main,Miyamura,0,0,0,,Because I've been wearing it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.64,0:20:49.70,Main,Hori,0,0,0,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.20,0:20:54.20,Main,Hori,0,0,0,,You're gonna wear it?!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.20,0:20:55.64,Main,Miyamura,0,0,0,,He'll never know.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.64,0:20:57.14,Main,Hori,0,0,0,,Maybe, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.94,0:20:59.92,Main,Hori,0,0,0,,Want to help me, Miyamura?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.11,0:21:03.49,Main,Miyamura,0,0,0,,It's my first time using paint like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.16,0:21:06.86,Main,Miyamura,0,0,0,,Wait, isn't that...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.74,0:21:12.62,Main,_Sign,0,0,0,,{\fnArial\b1\fs20\shad0\c&H1A1C21&\3c&HE9F0EE&\pos(544.001,64.241)}Destroying\Nthe evidence
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.37,0:21:21.37,Main,Mizouchi,0,0,0,,Hori.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.44,0:21:23.63,Main,Mizouchi,0,0,0,,You done?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.63,0:21:25.53,Main,Hori,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.53,0:21:26.63,Main,Hori,0,0,0,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.11,0:21:28.52,Main,Mizouchi,0,0,0,,Not cold anymore?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.52,0:21:29.54,Main,Hori,0,0,0,,Nope.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.47,0:21:33.14,Main,Mizouchi,0,0,0,,Let me know if you need anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.33,0:21:39.27,Main,Miyamura,0,0,0,,I hope Mizouchi-kun just keeps walking
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.27,0:21:45.42,Main,Miyamura,0,0,0,,and will never know the difference\Nbetween your body heat and mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.77,0:21:47.68,Main,Hori,0,0,0,,Honestly...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.65,0:21:51.16,Main,Hori,0,0,0,,Are you jealous?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.12,0:21:53.16,Main,Hori,0,0,0,,You are!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.14,0:22:03.46,Main,Miyamura,0,0,0,,What are you giggling about?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.71,0:22:09.46,Main,Mizouchi,0,0,0,,She had it on her lap,\N but the sleeves are warm?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.56,0:23:40.02,Main,_Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(487,1)\c&HC2A774&\3c&HF4F9ED&\shad0\an7\fs16\pos(469.385,315.458)}Next time\Npage.3 Sports Day
